completed_at: "2026-08-14T08:28:44.356Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: The test resolves the seeded item document through the same canonical type-folder contract used by production; The original authoritative re-read assertion remains intact and fails under a deliberately stale cache negative control; Windows and POSIX focused runs pass without OS-specific path literals; The nightly issue is linked to this item and a rerun or successor exact-head run is green; Recurrence is typed incident_from the prior Windows harness-hardening lineage
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: 96
reporter: GitHub issue #1011
severity: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: The cache-order regression runs and passes on every supported nightly platform and Node version using canonical item path semantics.
actual_result: Canonical path joining preserves the authoritative cached-test collection on Windows and POSIX; PR #1013 head 8beb34a269f08fca28748960531b8b74656c86a4 passed Windows regression (Node 24).
affected_version: 2026.8.14
regression: true
customer_impact: The nightly signal cannot distinguish a product regression from a platform-specific fixture bug.
